zh.articleInline:
设计一张文章正文配图。

从指定段落与文章语境中提炼一个清晰、具象、可一眼识别的视觉内容。画面应直接帮助读者理解当前段落，不重复题图，不做无关装饰。

整体简洁、现代、克制、美观，具有高质量科技商业媒体或杂志内页插图的编辑质感；不要做成 SaaS 落地页、演示文稿或信息图。

画面比例严格为 {比例}（{宽度}×{高度}）。
{对应画幅的构图约束}

画面中不要生成标题、段落、Logo、水印或其他可读文字。避免蓝紫夜间配色、霓虹赛博朋克、无意义渐变、拥挤排版和过度装饰。

文章题目：{题目}

配图段落：
{段落}

正文（仅做补充语境参考）：
{正文}

zh.socialCover:
设计一张社媒贴图封面。

从题目与正文中提炼一个明确、具象、适合信息流快速识别的核心视觉。整体简洁、现代、克制、美观，具有高质量编辑设计或杂志封面的质感。

画面比例严格为 {比例}（{宽度}×{高度}）。
{对应画幅的构图约束}

在缩略图尺寸下仍要主体明确、层次清晰、视觉重心稳定。不要出现安全区、辅助线、模板说明、Logo、水印或不可读文字。避免蓝紫夜间配色、霓虹赛博朋克、无意义渐变和拥挤排版。

题目：{题目}

正文（仅做语境参考）：
{正文}

en.articleInline:
Design an inline illustration for an article.

Extract one clear, concrete, immediately recognizable visual from the selected passage and article context. It should help the reader understand this passage directly, without repeating the hero image or adding unrelated decoration.

Keep it minimal, modern, restrained, and polished, with the editorial quality of a premium technology-business publication or magazine interior; do not make a SaaS landing page, slide, or infographic.

Use a strict {比例} aspect ratio ({宽度}×{高度}).
{对应画幅的构图约束}

Do not render headlines, paragraphs, logos, watermarks, or other readable text. Avoid blue-purple night palettes, neon cyberpunk, arbitrary gradients, crowded layouts, and excessive decoration.

Article title: {题目}

Selected passage:
{段落}

Additional article context:
{正文}

en.socialCover:
Design a cover image for a social post.

Extract one clear, concrete visual that reads immediately in a fast-moving feed. Keep it minimal, modern, restrained, and polished, with premium editorial or magazine-cover quality.

Use a strict {比例} aspect ratio ({宽度}×{高度}).
{对应画幅的构图约束}

The subject must remain clear, layered, and visually stable at thumbnail size. Do not show safe areas, guides, template notes, logos, watermarks, or illegible text. Avoid blue-purple night palettes, neon cyberpunk, arbitrary gradients, and crowded layouts.

Title: {题目}

Post context:
{正文}
